$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=mvfej  LOC_AFTER=?

* The Fejer identity in finite form: the integral of sin ^ 2 ( A t ) cos ( H t ) / t ^ 2 over ( 0 , R ) is ( pi / 4 ) max ( 0 , 2 A - | H | ) up to 2 / R (replaces MeanValue integral_fejer_mul_exp: no Fourier inversion).

